;Command Line Tooling;;Command line tool that surveys code and specs, reshapes branches, and applies editor edits.
;Command Line Tooling/Code Behaviour;;How the tool behaves on code: reshaping wide branches and applying editor edits to the tree.
;Command Line Tooling/Code Behaviour/Reshape Wide Branches;;Reshaping overly wide branches into smaller groups through a standalone workflow or repeated rounds.
1;Command Line Tooling/Code Behaviour/Reshape Wide Branches/Standalone Reshape Workflow;skills/whitebox/reshape.js:1-11;Regroups branches wider than nine children in a standalone run, applying the merge step first only when the tree file is missing.
1;Command Line Tooling/Code Behaviour/Reshape Wide Branches/Reshape Round Loop;skills/whitebox/reshape.js:12-26;Repeats up to three rounds: counts branches wider than nine children, reshapes each with up to two attempts running concurrently, and stops early once none remain.
;Command Line Tooling/Code Behaviour/Apply Editor Edits;;Applying edits exported from the HTML editor, with line verification and exit status reporting.
1;Command Line Tooling/Code Behaviour/Apply Editor Edits/Command Line Interface;skills/whitebox/scripts/apply-edits.mjs:1-16;Reads an edits file exported from the editor with optional root directory, dry run and drop excluded options, and prints usage and fails when no file is given.
1;Command Line Tooling/Code Behaviour/Apply Editor Edits/Verify Lines Before Writing;skills/whitebox/scripts/apply-edits.mjs:17-36;Applies edits per file from bottom to top, leaving a file untouched and reporting a conflict when its current lines differ from the recorded original text or edits overlap.
1;Command Line Tooling/Code Behaviour/Apply Editor Edits/Results And Exit Status;skills/whitebox/scripts/apply-edits.mjs:37-38;Prints the number of changes applied and conflicts, marks dry runs as such, and exits with a failure status when any conflict occurred.
;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation;;Producing the editor page, outline listings and JSON, and checking source text and tree shape.
;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Editor Page;;Writing the standalone interactive HTML editor page for reviewing the tree.
2;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Editor Page/Write Standalone Editor;skills/whitebox/scripts/build-editor.mjs:1-10;Produces a standalone HTML editor file by embedding the outline JSON, with angle brackets escaped so the data cannot break the page, and reports the path written.
;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Check Source Text;;Verifying that tree leaves match source text, resolving base directories and covering every source line.
2;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Check Source Text/Resolve Source Base Directory;skills/whitebox/scripts/validate.mjs:1-10;Loads the outline file and resolves the project root against its location so that every leaf source file can be read from disk.
2;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Check Source Text/Match Leaf Text;skills/whitebox/scripts/validate.mjs:31-38;Checks that each leaf text equals the exact lines it cites in its source file, and reports leaves that are too long or start or end on a blank line.
2;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Check Source Text/Verify Line Coverage;skills/whitebox/scripts/validate.mjs:39-49;Checks that cited line ranges do not overlap within a file and that every non-blank content line is covered by a leaf, then prints a summary with any warnings and errors.
;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Check Tree Shape;;Verifying that every node in the tree has a valid structure.
2;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Check Tree Shape/Verify Node Structure;skills/whitebox/scripts/validate.mjs:11-30;Checks that every node has a unique id and a title of two to four words, flags empty branches, and warns about root width, depth above eight, and single-child branches.
;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Outline Tree;;Building the tree from rows and writing the JSON and text listing output.
2;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Outline Tree/Build Tree From Rows;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:538-553;Builds the outline tree from the tree rows, giving each leaf the text of its cited lines and each node a unique id, titled from the project folder name.
2;Command Line Tooling/Output And Validation/Outline Tree/Write Json And Listing;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:554-565;Writes the outline JSON file and a flat listing with one line per node giving its group, path, file range and description, then reports the node and description counts.
;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection;;Reading markdown and source files, selecting files and turning them into bounded pieces.
;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Command Entry;;Describing the available commands and parsing their command-line options.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Command Entry/Describe Commands;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:1-20;Documents the command set and arguments of the tool and marks the script as an executable entry point.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Command Entry/Parse Command Options;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:21-42;Parses the command name, positional arguments and value options such as work directory, window size, group count and size limits, falling back to defaults when an option is absent.
;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Scan Document Blocks;;Parsing markdown blocks and nesting sections by heading level.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Scan Document Blocks/Parse Markdown Blocks;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:43-58;Splits a markdown file into blocks of headings, table rows, list items, fenced code and paragraphs, keeping each block's start and end line numbers.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Scan Document Blocks/Nest Sections By Level;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:59-71;Nests markdown blocks under the most recent heading of a shallower level, so each section keeps its heading path and its content.
;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Limit Piece Length;;Splitting overlong units and packing small units together to keep pieces a manageable size.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Limit Piece Length/Split Long Units;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:72-87;Splits an oversized unit into consecutive chunks of at most a word limit, breaking at line boundaries and preferring blank lines for code, and never produces an empty chunk.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Limit Piece Length/Pack Small Units Together;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:88-97;Merges adjacent small units into one piece while the combined length stays within the limit, so tiny sections do not become separate pieces.
;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Assemble Pieces;;Collecting the parsed pieces into their sections for the tree.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Assemble Pieces/Collect Pieces Per Section;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:98-107;Turns each section into pieces by heading path, packing its blocks within the length limit and keeping the section headings with its pieces.
;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Discover Files;;Finding project files by walking the directory tree and collecting tracked files.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Discover Files/Walk Directory Tree;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:108-108;Walks a directory tree recursively and lists every file path relative to the root directory.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Discover Files/Collect Tracked Project Files;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:119-135;Lists project files from git, including untracked files not ignored by git, and falls back to walking the folder when it is not a git repository.
;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Classify Files;;Defining which files are selected for the tree and filtering out excluded files.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Classify Files/Define Selection Rules;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:110-118;Decides by extension whether a file is documentation, code or config, and which directories, lockfiles, secrets and generated files are skipped by default.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Classify Files/Filter Excluded Files;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:136-153;Excludes lockfiles, minified and source-map files, unknown or binary types, oversized sources, secrets and generated code, and counts each reason for the report.
;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Segment Source Code;;Splitting source code into top-level units by tracking brace depth.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Segment Source Code/Track Brace Depth;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:154-173;Scans source lines while tracking bracket and parenthesis depth, ignoring comments and string contents, so that top-level declarations can be identified.
2;Command Line Tooling/Parsing And Selection/Segment Source Code/Close Top Level Units;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:174-184;Closes a code unit when depth returns to zero on a line that is not a closing bracket or chained continuation, keeping leading comments with the declaration that follows.
;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows;;Cutting pieces into balanced groups and windows for model tasks, then checking and reporting their results.
;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Build Pieces And Groups;;Segmenting selected files, forming balanced groups and cutting windows within each group.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Build Pieces And Groups/Segment Selected Files;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:186-204;Builds the list of pieces for each selected file by splitting its markdown sections or code units, giving each piece its file, line range and kind.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Build Pieces And Groups/Form Balanced Groups;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:205-218;Groups files into contiguous families and sorts them into roughly equal groups by byte count, keeping numbered variants of one file together.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Build Pieces And Groups/Cut Windows Within Groups;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:219-235;Cuts each group into consecutive windows of about the configured piece count, preferring file boundaries near the target so each window is a reasonable size.
;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Report Split Results;;Writing split artifacts and emitting group metadata after a split.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Report Split Results/Write Split Artifacts;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:236-257;Writes the pieces, groups and cost estimate files to the work directory and prints the file count, piece count, group sizes and estimated token cost.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Report Split Results/Emit Group Metadata;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:534-536;Prints the work directory, the command path and the list of groups as JSON so that other steps can address each group and window.
;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Read Window Outputs;;Loading the rows produced by each window.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Read Window Outputs/Load Window Rows;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:259-268;Reads a window output file and parses each row into an id and a path, returning nothing when the window has no output yet.
;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Print Window Task;;Printing the window task with branch vocabulary, code rules and the piece listing.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Print Window Task/Collect Existing Branch Vocabulary;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:270-281;Collects the branch paths already created by earlier windows of the group, with their piece counts, so that later windows reuse the same branch names.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Print Window Task/Compose Code Rules Text;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:282-291;Composes the rules for code pieces: each one also gets a plain-language specification of its behaviour that states what the system does, not how the code is written.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Print Window Task/Print Task Rules;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:293-304;Prints the numbered task rules for a window, including its id range, the path segment format, the depth limits and the requirement that every id appears exactly once.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Print Window Task/Print Piece Listing;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:305-322;Prints the instructions, the previous summary, the existing branches, and then each piece under a heading naming its file.
;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Check Window Rows;;Validating window row format and verifying that every full id is covered.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Check Window Rows/Validate Window Row Format;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:324-339;Validates each row of a window output: ids must be integers within the window range and unique, and each path must be a well-formed multi-segment title path.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Check Window Rows/Verify Full Id Coverage;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:340-350;Reports ids from the window range that have no row, requires the window summary file to exist, and rejects summaries longer than one hundred twenty words.
;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Check All Windows;;Reporting failing windows and overall progress across all windows.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Check All Windows/Report Failing Windows;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:352-359;Checks every window of every group and prints a JSON list of failing windows with their error details.
2;Command Line Tooling/Split And Windows/Check All Windows/Report Overall Progress;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:360-364;Walks all groups and windows and prints the progress of each group together with the overall count of finished windows.
;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping;;Applying merges, describing branches and reshaping the tree when branches are too wide.
;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Prepare Merge Instructions;;Printing the merge input and composing the rules for merging branches.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Prepare Merge Instructions/Print Merge Input;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:365-380;Prints a merge listing for each group with its files, top-level branches, piece counts and sample sub-branches.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Prepare Merge Instructions/Compose Merge Rules;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:382-392;Describes the merge rules: each group top segment maps to a new prefix, shared themes share one prefix, and the final tree has three to eight top-level branches.
;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Apply Merge Mapping;;Reading a merge mapping file and remapping groups while resolving path collisions.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Apply Merge Mapping/Read Merge Mapping File;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:393-396;Reads the merge mapping file into one mapping per group and top segment, and fails with a clear message when the file is missing.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Apply Merge Mapping/Remap Group Top Segments;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:397-408;Replaces the top segment of every row with its mapped prefix, and fails when a group and segment has no mapping or has two.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Apply Merge Mapping/Resolve Path Collisions;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:409-419;Resolves duplicate paths and paths that are prefixes of other paths by adding a numeric suffix, then writes the final tree paths and leaf descriptions.
;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Branch Width Counts;;Counting children per branch and reporting how wide the tree is.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Branch Width Counts/Report Tree Width;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:420-426;Reports the number of pieces and top-level branches, with a warning listing the branches that have more than nine children.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Branch Width Counts/Count Children Per Branch;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:460-464;Counts the children of each branch in the tree, whether leaf or sub-branch, and returns the counts keyed by branch path.
;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Describe Branch Text;;Printing description tasks, verifying branch descriptions and loading or saving them.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Describe Branch Text/Print Branch Description Task;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:427-440;Prints a task listing each branch up to depth three with example children and asks for one-sentence descriptions written to the group description file.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Describe Branch Text/Verify Branch Descriptions;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:441-452;Checks that every branch up to depth three of the group has a non-empty description, and fails listing the branch paths that lack one.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Describe Branch Text/Load And Save Descriptions;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:453-459;Loads branch descriptions from the description folder into one map and saves the combined map back to a single file.
;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Reshape Plan;;Listing wide branches and printing the reshape task with its composed rules.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Reshape Plan/List Wide Branches;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:465-477;Lists branches with more than nine children sorted by child count, numbers them for reshaping, and moves earlier reshape results aside.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Reshape Plan/Print Reshape Task;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:478-487;Prints the task for one wide branch, showing each child with its piece count or sample text, and the instructions for writing its grouping file.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Reshape Plan/Compose Reshape Rules;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:488-499;Gives the rules for grouping the children of a wide branch into two to nine groups with unique titles, and reads the grouping file into child and group pairs.
;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Reshape Results;;Validating reshape groups and remounting children under their new groups.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Reshape Results/Validate Reshape Groups;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:500-514;Validates a grouping file: each child appears exactly once, group titles are two to four words and differ from every child title, and each group holds two to nine children.
2;Command Line Tooling/Themes And Reshaping/Reshape Results/Remount Children Under Groups;skills/whitebox/scripts/whitebox.mjs:515-532;Moves the children of each wide branch under their group titles, deepest branches first, carrying descriptions along, and skips branches that have no grouping file.
;Workflow And Testing;;Workflow orchestration and the test harness that exercises it, covering phases, fixtures and simulated agents.
;Workflow And Testing/Workflow Orchestration;;Orchestration of workflow runs, centered on executing the declared phases in order.
;Workflow And Testing/Workflow Orchestration/Phase Execution;;Declares workflow phases and runs them, outlining windows, redoing failures and splitting wide branches.
4;Workflow And Testing/Workflow Orchestration/Phase Execution/Declare Workflow Phases;skills/whitebox/workflow.js:1-18;Declares the workflow name and description and five phases, Outline, Verify, Merge, Describe and Reshape, each run by a haiku model.
4;Workflow And Testing/Workflow Orchestration/Phase Execution/Outline Each Window;skills/whitebox/workflow.js:20-37;Runs each window of every group as a haiku agent in order, retrying a failed window up to two times before reporting it as failed.
4;Workflow And Testing/Workflow Orchestration/Phase Execution/Redo Failing Windows;skills/whitebox/workflow.js:38-62;Runs up to three verification rounds over all windows, redoing only failing windows in group and window order and stopping once none fail.
4;Workflow And Testing/Workflow Orchestration/Phase Execution/Split Wide Branches;skills/whitebox/workflow.js:63-78;Repeats up to three rounds splitting branches wider than nine children, retrying each split up to two times and stopping when no branch is too wide.
;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness;;Shared test infrastructure: support helpers, fixture projects and fake agents used across the test suite.
;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Test Support;;Helpers for module setup and for running scripts without throwing, used by tests.
4;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Test Support/Module Setup;test/helpers.mjs:1-11;Provides repository root, scripts directory and CLI path constants, plus a helper that creates uniquely named temporary directories.
4;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Test Support/Run Script Without Throwing;test/helpers.mjs:13-18;Runs a script with arguments and returns its exit code and combined output, returning failure details instead of raising an error.
;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Fixture Projects;;Fixture projects for tests: a git repository, a sample build and a Go greeting handler.
4;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Fixture Projects/Create Git Project;test/helpers.mjs:20-37;Creates a temporary directory from a map of relative paths to contents, optionally writes an ignore file and initializes a git repository.
4;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Fixture Projects/Build Sample Project;test/helpers.mjs:65-82;Builds a sample project of nine markdown topic files with numbered rules, plus Go and Python sources, large enough to produce at least three groups.
4;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Fixture Projects/Go Greeting Handler Fixture;test/helpers.mjs:84-121;Provides a Go fixture whose Handle returns a fixed message for an empty name and a greeting otherwise, and whose Helper formats a value for logging.
;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Fake Agents;;Simulated outline and description agents that stand in for real model calls during tests.
4;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Fake Agents/Simulate Outline Agents;test/helpers.mjs:38-55;Writes stand-in outline summaries and valid piece lines for every window of each group, deriving short theme names from source file names.
4;Workflow And Testing/Test Harness/Fake Agents/Simulate Description Agents;test/helpers.mjs:56-63;Writes a description file per group covering every branch path in the tree, each described by a generic sentence built from its path.
